    "segmenter examples) gates against.",
    "Owner: KindaHealthyMobile sync-docs/reports/2026-09-12_spanish-eval-corpus-baseline.md",
    "Planner entry: sync-docs/reports/2026-09-11_spanish-version-scoping-and-insertion.md (punch #170).",
    "",
    "rawText is UNACCENTED on purpose: it is what a phone keyboard produces without long-press, and",
    "it is the harder input. Accented spellings are a separate axis and are not measured here.",
    "",
    "Bands are scale-free per-100g, derived the way golden-set.json cases are, so the IDENTITY axis",
    "and the PORTION axis separate: a band failure is a wrong record, a grams surprise is a wrong",
    "portion. An empty `macros` means the line is graded on segmentation/identity only.",
    "",
    "`meansEnglish` is what the user MEANT, for grading. It is not a translation the pipeline does."
  ],
